<title>RUSSIA: Rouble fixed at 3,289 per mark in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble fixed at 3,289 per mark in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble was set at 3,289 to the German mark on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange (MICEX) on Wednesday.</p>
<p>				    July 9		  July 8</p>
<p> Mark rate			3,289		   3,313</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7 095 941 8520</p>
